\fs32 \cf2 For types that support default construction, you can use the simpler {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/python/bindings/PythonTypeBuilder/#def_init_defaultable"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb18 \ul def_init_defaultable()}} method:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf14 \cb19 \uc0\u55357 \u56613  Mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 var\cf14  counter_type \cf5 =\cf14  m\cf5 .\cf14 add_type\cf5 [\cf14 Counter\cf5 ](\cf22 "Counter"\cf5 )\cf14 \cb1 \
\cb15 counter_type\cf5 .\cf14 def_init_defaultable\cf5 [\cf14 Counter\cf5 ]()\cf14 \cb1 \
