\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf17 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Passing invalid arguments will result in a runtime argument error:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf14 \cb19 \uc0\u55357 \u56333  Python\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf14 \cb15 person \cf5 =\cf14  mojo_module\cf5 .\cf14 create_person\cf5 (\cf21 42\cf5 )\cf14 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf16 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf17 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs35 \cf10 \cb18 PythonObject
\fs40 \cf2 \cb1  downcasts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 Downcasting from 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 PythonObject
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  values to the inner Mojo value:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf14 \cb19 \uc0\u55357 \u56613  Mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 def\cf14  \cf20 print_age\cf5 (\cf14 person_obj\cf5 :\cf14  PythonObject\cf5 )\cf14  raises\cf5 :\cf14 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf6 # Raises if `obj` does not contain an instance of the Mojo `Person` type.\cf14 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf5 var\cf14  person \cf5 =\cf14  person_obj\cf5 .\cf14 downcast_value_ptr\cf5 [\cf14 Person\cf5 ]()\cf14 \cb1 \
\
\cb15     \cf5 print(\cf22 "Person is"\cf5 ,\cf14  person\cf5 [].\cf14 age\cf5 ,\cf14  \cf22 "years old"\cf5 )\cf14 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf16 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf17 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Unsafe mutation via downcasting is also supported. It is up to the user to ensure that this mutable pointer does not alias any other pointers to the same object within Mojo:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf14 \cb19 \uc0\u55357 \u56613  Mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 def\cf14  \cf20 birthday\cf5 (\cf14 person_obj\cf5 :\cf14  PythonObject\cf5 ):\cf14 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf5 var\cf14  person \cf5 =\cf14  person_obj\cf5 .\cf14 downcast_value_ptr\cf5 [\cf14 Person\cf5 ]()\cf14 \cb1 \
\
\cb15     person\cf5 [].\cf14 age \cf5 +=\cf14  \cf21 1\cf14 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf16 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf17 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Entirely unchecked downcasting\'97which does no type checking\'97can be done using:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28\fsmilli14400 \cf14 \cb19 \uc0\u55357 \u56613  Mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb15 def\cf14  \cf20 get_person\cf5 (\cf14 person_obj\cf5 :\cf14  PythonObject\cf5 ):\cf14 \cb1 \
\cb15     \cf5 var\cf14  person \cf5 =\cf14  person_obj\cf5 .\cf14 unchecked_downcast_value_ptr\cf5 [\cf14 Person\cf5 ]()\cf14 \cb1 \
